{"id": "rmc-bay-sand-royalty-settlement", "title": "A second Bay sand operator settled a separate state royalties case", "seconds": 48.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "d1aee47bc153b80d", "words": 119, "beats": [{"scene": "leases", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "RMC Pacific Materials held two state sand extraction leases.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.17, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["What", "did", "California", "settle?"], "sub": "RMC sand extraction leases"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.52, 0.95, 1.51, 1.74, 2.03, 2.43, 2.74, 3.35]}, {"scene": "leases", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "One tract covered about 421 acres in San Francisco County.", "t0": 4.29, "t1": 8.74, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "State Lands Commission", "heading": "Two separate tracts", "source": "bay", "rows": [{"icon": "map", "label": "San Francisco County", "value": "421 acres"}, {"icon": "map", "label": "Contra Costa and Solano counties", "value": "474 acres"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.7, 1.03, 1.33, 1.6, 1.91, 2.5, 2.94, 3.07, 3.33, 3.94]}, {"scene": "leases", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The other covered about 474 acres in Contra Costa and Solano counties.", "t0": 8.86, "t1": 14.51, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "strait", "kicker": "California State Lands Commission", "text": "Second lease", "mark": "Second lease"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.47, 0.84, 1.14, 1.43, 1.84, 2.54, 3.05, 3.22, 3.64, 4.23, 4.42, 4.96]}, {"scene": "leases", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Bell Marine assigned both leases in December 1999.", "t0": 14.63, "t1": 18.46, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Lease assignment"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.72, 1.14, 1.47, 1.97, 2.09, 2.65, 3.07]}, {"scene": "civil", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "California alleged that RMC underreported royalties and mined outside authorized areas.", "t0": 18.68, "t1": 24.54, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "doj", "kicker": "California Department of Justice", "text": "Attorney General report", "mark": "Attorney General report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.71, 1.09, 1.33, 1.93, 2.7, 3.38, 3.62, 4.04, 4.58, 5.2]}, {"scene": "civil", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The Attorney General reported a 2008 civil settlement of 1.1 million dollars.", "t0": 24.66, "t1": 30.11, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1.1 million", "label": "Civil settlement in 2008"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.55, 0.91, 1.37, 1.46, 1.71, 2.14, 2.45, 2.8, 3.34, 3.54, 3.77, 4.11, 4.35, 4.78]}, {"scene": "civil", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "In August 2008, the State Lands Commission considered both lease quitclaims.", "t0": 30.23, "t1": 35.01, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "record", "kicker": "California State Lands Commission", "text": "Commission meeting record", "mark": "Commission meeting record"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.61, 0.78, 1.18, 1.48, 1.61, 1.96, 2.27, 2.75, 3.23, 3.55, 3.87]}, {"scene": "civil", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Staff said RMC chose not to exercise its option for another ten years.", "t0": 35.13, "t1": 39.65, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "strait", "kicker": "California State Lands Commission", "text": "Lease staff report", "mark": "Lease staff report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.48, 0.74, 1.34, 1.71, 1.91, 2.01, 2.61, 2.8, 3.21, 3.37, 3.71, 3.99]}, {"scene": "civil", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "Was returning the leases a settlement condition? The public records do not say.", "t0": 39.77, "t1": 44.63, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Settlement agreement", "Final allocation"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.68, 0.8, 1.23, 1.32, 1.79, 2.86, 3.05, 3.45, 3.97, 4.17, 4.42]}, {"scene": "civil", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 44.75, "t1": 47.36, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.8, 0.97, 1.29, 1.39, 1.48, 1.78, 2.11]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"leases": "Which leases did RMC hold?", "civil": "The settlement and the leases"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "question"}